WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
Who pays to protect people from heat?

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:09.980
A cooler workplace helps workers, the business, its buyers, insurers, and the public purse.

3
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:15.890
But often no single one of them has the reason, or the money, to pay for all of it.

4
00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.390
The heat economy maps who builds, funds and buys protection.
